# mlkem kv data present reset only dependent on mldsa_valid

- Source URL: https://github.com/chipsalliance/adams-bridge/issues/215

In the abr_ctrl module "kv_data_present_reset" signal is used to reset mldsa seed, mlkem msg and seed. But the trigger for this signal is only dependent on the mldsa_valid_reg, instead it should be mldsa_valid_reg | mlkem_valid_reg.

